# Apache combined-format fixture for AccessLogParser. Lines starting with # are
# ignored by the parser (they are not valid log lines) and exist so this file
# can be annotated.
#
# Coverage:
#   - a human visitor with two page views and one asset (Chrome / Windows)
#   - a 31-minute gap for the same IP, which must split into a second visit
#   - a mobile visitor (Safari / iOS) arriving from an external referrer
#   - named robots: Googlebot, bingbot, Amazonbot and an unnamed crawler
#   - a "-" user agent and an empty user agent (both must count as robots)
#   - asset, api, page and 404 classification
#   - loopback (127.0.0.1) and RFC1918 (192.168.x) traffic, which must be dropped
#   - two malformed lines that must be counted as skipped, not thrown on
#
# Timestamps are written in UTC (+0000) on 2026-10-04; the parser converts
# them into whatever timezone the caller passes.
